            <ArticleTitle>The Pain Behaviour Checklist: factor analysis and validation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>301-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A factor analysis was performed on Philips &amp; Hunter's (1981) Pain Behaviour Checklist for headache sufferers. Three intuitively meaningful factors emerged. All were similarly associated with overall intensity; pain severity does not determine type of pain behaviour. Differences in pain behaviour emerged between migraine and tension headache groups.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
